# This directory holds mkcert-generated TLS certificates for local HTTPS development.
# Generate certificates with:
#   mkcert localhost 127.0.0.1 ::1 mkobazuna.local
#   cp localhost+2.pem fullchain.pem
#   cp localhost+2-key.pem privkey.pem
#
# Note: Filenames may vary (e.g., localhost.pem, localhost+2.pem) based on mkcert version.
# The .gitkeep preserves this directory; certificate files are gitignored.
# See docs/ops/local-https-mkcert.md for complete setup instructions.